OH Cryptography System Installation Guide
*****************************************
The OH Cryptography System supports both cmake and traditional GNU make.

To compile ohcs, the GNU Multiple Precision Arithmetic Library and
Boost library are required.

Easy Install Guide
==================
Using cmake:
	$ mkdir build
	$ cd build
	$ cmake ..
	$ cmake --build .
	# cmake --install . # RUN AS ROOT
The program will be installed at /usr/local/bin.